Common Stock</B>&rdquo; means the common stock, $0.00001 par value per share, of MEDS.</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&ldquo;<B>MEDS
Contract</B>&rdquo; means any Contract: (a) to which MEDS is a party, (b) by which MEDS or any MEDS IP Rights or any other asset of MEDS
is or may become bound or under which MEDS has, or may become subject to, any obligation or (c) under which MEDS has or may acquire any
right or interest.</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&ldquo;<B>MEDS
Covered Person</B>&rdquo; means, with respect to MEDS as an &ldquo;issuer&rdquo; for purposes of Rule 506 promulgated under the Securities
Act, any Person listed in the first paragraph of Rule 506(d)(1).</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&nbsp;</P>

